{
 "help": {
  "tabs": [
   {
    "id": "overview",
    "title": "⟦h¦¦Overview⟧",
    "content": "<p>⟦r¦¦Permalinks are the permanent URLs to your individual pages and blog posts, as well as your category and tag archives. A permalink is the web address used to link to your content. The URL to each post should be permanent, and never change &#8212; hence the name permalink.⟧</p><p>⟦r¦¦This screen allows you to choose your permalink structure. You can choose from common settings or create custom URL structures.⟧</p><p>⟦r¦¦You must click the Save Changes button at the bottom of the screen for new settings to take effect.⟧</p>"
   },
   {
    "id": "permalink-settings",
    "title": "⟦h¦¦Permalink Settings⟧",
    "content": "<p>⟦r¦¦Permalinks can contain useful information, such as the post date, title, or other elements. You can choose from any of the suggested permalink formats, or you can craft your own if you select Custom Structure.⟧</p><p>⟦r¦¦If you pick an option other than Plain, your general URL path with structure tags (terms surrounded by ⟪%s¦<code>%</code>⟫) will also appear in the custom structure field and your path can be further modified there.⟧</p><p>⟦r¦¦When you assign multiple categories or tags to a post, only one can show up in the permalink: the lowest numbered category. This applies if your custom structure includes ⟪%1$s¦<code>%category%</code>⟫ or ⟪%2$s¦<code>%tag%</code>⟫.⟧</p><p>⟦r¦¦You must click the Save Changes button at the bottom of the screen for new settings to take effect.⟧</p>"
   },
   {
    "id": "custom-structures",
    "title": "⟦h¦¦Custom Structures⟧",
    "content": "<p>⟦r¦¦The Optional fields let you customize the &#8220;category&#8221; and &#8220;tag&#8221; base names that will appear in archive URLs. For example, the page listing all posts in the &#8220;Uncategorized&#8221; category could be <code>/topics/uncategorized</code> instead of <code>/category/uncategorized</code>.⟧</p><p>⟦r¦¦You must click the Save Changes button at the bottom of the screen for new settings to take effect.⟧</p>"
   }
  ],
  "sidebar": "<p><strong>⟦r¦¦For more information:⟧</strong></p><p>⟦r¦¦<a href=\"https://wordpress.org/documentation/article/settings-permalinks-screen/\">Documentation on Permalinks Settings</a>⟧</p><p>⟦r¦¦<a href=\"https://wordpress.org/documentation/article/customize-permalinks/\">Documentation on Using Permalinks</a>⟧</p><p>⟦r¦¦<a href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/forums/\">Support forums</a>⟧</p>"
 },
 "content": "<div class=\"wrap\">\n<h1>⟦h¦¦Permalink Settings⟧</h1>\n\n<form name=\"form\" action=\"options-permalink.php\" method=\"post\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" id=\"_wpnonce\" name=\"_wpnonce\" value=\"585a575f4c\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wp_http_referer\" value=\"/wp-admin/options-permalink.php\" />\n<p>\n⟦r¦¦WordPress offers you the ability to create a custom URL structure for your permalinks and archives. Custom URL structures can improve the aesthetics, usability, and forward-compatibility of your links. A <a href=\"⟪%s¦⟦r¦¦https://wordpress.org/documentation/article/customize-permalinks/⟧⟫\">number of tags are available</a>, and here are some examples to get you started.⟧</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"wp-settings-section-common-settings\" class=\"title\">⟦r¦¦Common Settings⟧</h2>\n<p>\n⟦r¦¦Select the permalink structure for your website. Including the ⟪%s¦<code>%postname%</code>⟫ tag makes links easy to understand, and can help your posts rank higher in search engines.⟧</p>\n<table class=\"form-table permalink-structure\" role=\"presentation\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n\t<th scope=\"row\">⟦r¦¦Permalink structure⟧</th>\n\t<td>\n\t\t<fieldset class=\"structure-selection\">\n\t\t\t<legend class=\"screen-reader-text\">⟦r¦¦Permalink structure⟧</legend>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t<input id=\"permalink-input-plain\"\n\t\t\t\t\tname=\"selection\" aria-describedby=\"permalink-plain\"\n\t\t\t\t\ttype=\"radio\" value=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t/>\n\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"permalink-input-plain\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t⟦h¦¦Plain⟧\t\t\t\t\t</label>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<code id=\"permalink-plain\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t{{site}}/?p=123\t\t\t\t\t\t</code>\n\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- .row -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t<input id=\"permalink-input-day-name\"\n\t\t\t\t\tname=\"selection\" aria-describedby=\"permalink-day-name\"\n\t\t\t\t\ttype=\"radio\" value=\"/%year%/%monthnum%/%day%/%postname%/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t/>\n\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"permalink-input-day-name\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t⟦h¦¦Day and name⟧\t\t\t\t\t</label>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<code id=\"permalink-day-name\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t{{site}}/2026/10/25/⟦h¦sample permalink structure¦sample-post⟧/\t\t\t\t\t\t</code>\n\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- .row -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t<input id=\"permalink-input-month-name\"\n\t\t\t\t\tname=\"selection\" aria-describedby=\"permalink-month-name\"\n\t\t\t\t\ttype=\"radio\" value=\"/%year%/%monthnum%/%postname%/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t/>\n\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"permalink-input-month-name\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t⟦h¦¦Month and name⟧\t\t\t\t\t</label>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<code id=\"permalink-month-name\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t{{site}}/2026/10/⟦h¦sample permalink structure¦sample-post⟧/\t\t\t\t\t\t</code>\n\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- .row -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t<input id=\"permalink-input-numeric\"\n\t\t\t\t\tname=\"selection\" aria-describedby=\"permalink-numeric\"\n\t\t\t\t\ttype=\"radio\" value=\"/⟦a¦sample permalink base¦archives⟧/%post_id%\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t/>\n\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"permalink-input-numeric\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t⟦h¦¦Numeric⟧\t\t\t\t\t</label>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<code id=\"permalink-numeric\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t{{site}}/⟦h¦sample permalink base¦archives⟧/123\t\t\t\t\t\t</code>\n\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- .row -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t<input id=\"permalink-input-post-name\"\n\t\t\t\t\tname=\"selection\" aria-describedby=\"permalink-post-name\"\n\t\t\t\t\ttype=\"radio\" value=\"/%postname%/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t checked='checked'\t\t\t\t/>\n\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"permalink-input-post-name\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t⟦h¦¦Post name⟧\t\t\t\t\t</label>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<code id=\"permalink-post-name\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t{{site}}/⟦h¦sample permalink structure¦sample-post⟧/\t\t\t\t\t\t</code>\n\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- .row -->\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t<input id=\"custom_selection\"\n\t\t\t\t\tname=\"selection\" type=\"radio\" value=\"custom\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t/>\n\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"custom_selection\">⟦r¦¦Custom Structure⟧</label>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"permalink_structure\" class=\"screen-reader-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t⟦r¦¦Customize permalink structure by selecting available tags⟧\t\t\t\t\t\t</label>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"code\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<code id=\"permalink-custom\">{{site}}</code>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<input name=\"permalink_structure\" id=\"permalink_structure\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttype=\"text\" value=\"/%postname%/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-describedby=\"permalink-custom\" class=\"regular-text code\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t/>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"available-structure-tags hide-if-no-js\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"custom_selection_updated\" aria-live=\"assertive\" class=\"screen-reader-text\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<fieldset>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<legend>⟦r¦¦Available tags:⟧</legend>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul role=\"list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"button button-secondary\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦year⟫ (The year of the post, four digits, for example 2004.)⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-added=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦year⟫ added to permalink structure⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-removed=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦year⟫ removed from permalink structure⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-used=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦year⟫ (already used in permalink structure)⟧\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t%year%\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"button button-secondary\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦monthnum⟫ (Month of the year, for example 05.)⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-added=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦monthnum⟫ added to permalink structure⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-removed=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦monthnum⟫ removed from permalink structure⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-used=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦monthnum⟫ (already used in permalink structure)⟧\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t%monthnum%\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"button button-secondary\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦day⟫ (Day of the month, for example 28.)⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-added=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦day⟫ added to permalink structure⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-removed=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦day⟫ removed from permalink structure⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-used=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦day⟫ (already used in permalink structure)⟧\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t%day%\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"button button-secondary\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦hour⟫ (Hour of the day, for example 15.)⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-added=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦hour⟫ added to permalink structure⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-removed=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦hour⟫ removed from permalink structure⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-used=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦hour⟫ (already used in permalink structure)⟧\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t%hour%\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"button button-secondary\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦minute⟫ (Minute of the hour, for example 43.)⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-added=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦minute⟫ added to permalink structure⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-removed=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦minute⟫ removed from permalink structure⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-used=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦minute⟫ (already used in permalink structure)⟧\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t%minute%\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"button button-secondary\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦second⟫ (Second of the minute, for example 33.)⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-added=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦second⟫ added to permalink structure⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-removed=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦second⟫ removed from permalink structure⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-used=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦second⟫ (already used in permalink structure)⟧\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t%second%\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"button button-secondary\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦post_id⟫ (The unique ID of the post, for example 423.)⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-added=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦post_id⟫ added to permalink structure⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-removed=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦post_id⟫ removed from permalink structure⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-used=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦post_id⟫ (already used in permalink structure)⟧\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t%post_id%\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"button button-secondary\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦postname⟫ (The sanitized post title (slug).)⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-added=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦postname⟫ added to permalink structure⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-removed=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦postname⟫ removed from permalink structure⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-used=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦postname⟫ (already used in permalink structure)⟧\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t%postname%\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"button button-secondary\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦category⟫ (Category slug. Nested sub-categories appear as nested directories in the URL.)⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-added=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦category⟫ added to permalink structure⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-removed=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦category⟫ removed from permalink structure⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-used=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦category⟫ (already used in permalink structure)⟧\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t%category%\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button type=\"button\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"button button-secondary\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦author⟫ (A sanitized version of the author name.)⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-added=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦author⟫ added to permalink structure⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-removed=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦author⟫ removed from permalink structure⟧\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-used=\"⟦a¦¦⟪%s¦author⟫ (already used in permalink structure)⟧\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t%author%\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div><!-- .available-structure-tags -->\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- .row -->\n\t\t</fieldset><!-- .structure-selection -->\n\t</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"wp-settings-section-optional\" class=\"title\">⟦r¦¦Optional⟧</h2>\n<p class=\"permalink-structure-optional-description\">\n⟦r¦¦If you like, you may enter custom structures for your category and tag URLs here. For example, using <code>topics</code> as your category base would make your category links like <code>⟪%s¦{{site}}⟫/topics/uncategorized/</code>. If you leave these blank the defaults will be used.⟧</p>\n\n<table class=\"form-table\" role=\"presentation\">\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<th>\n\t\t\t<label for=\"category_base\">\n\t\t\t\t⟦r¦¦Category base⟧\t\t\t</label>\n\t\t</th>\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t<input name=\"category_base\" id=\"category_base\" type=\"text\"\n\t\t\t\tvalue=\"\" class=\"regular-text code\"\n\t\t\t/>\n\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t</tr>\n\t<tr>\n\t\t<th>\n\t\t\t<label for=\"tag_base\">⟦r¦¦Tag base⟧</label>\n\t\t</th>\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t\t\t\t<input name=\"tag_base\" id=\"tag_base\" type=\"text\"\n\t\t\t\tvalue=\"\" class=\"regular-text code\"\n\t\t\t/>\n\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t</tr>\n\t</table>\n\n\n<p class=\"submit\"><input type=\"submit\" name=\"submit\" id=\"submit\" class=\"button button-primary\" value=\"⟦a¦¦Save Changes⟧\"  /></p></form>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n</div><!-- .wrap -->\n\n\n"
}